      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've looked into the counselors and the help stuff... it's all just more paperwork and more promises that never actually change the numbers. it feels like a joke. it's like i'm just rearranging deck chairs on a sinking ship. at some point, you just have to admit that the ship is going down and there's nothing left to do but let it happen.",
